    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a practical, hands-on approach to math—using it for problem-solving in physics and chemistry. I enjoy its structure but don't see it as abstract theory. It’s a tool for understanding the world, not just a subject to memorize. My background in STEM helps me appreciate its real-world applications.",
