    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI for quick problem-solving and explanations. Tools like Wolfram Alpha helped me verify solutions and understand steps. The experience was positive—fast and accurate, but I still prefer manual calculation for deeper understanding. It’s a great supplement, not a replacement.",
